	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Usage

lens [image URL or local path]: search Google Lens.
yimg [image URL or local path]: search Yandex Images.
Run either keyword without an argument to select a screenshot area.

Universal Actions: select one image file, then choose Search Google Lens or Search Yandex Images.

Google opens a one-shot local upload page in the macOS default browser so browser cookies and image data stay in one session. Yandex uploads directly and opens its result URL. No clipboard paste or Accessibility permission is required.</string>
